      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AWS Quick is the AI workspace built only for work, where teams use AI agents to research, analyze, and act across the data and applications they already rely on.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/professional-work-deserves-professional-tools-meet-aws-quick/",
