      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Across virtually every industry, leading enterprises including 3M, BMW, Mondelez, New York Life, and Southwest Airlines are using Quick to transform how they work.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/professional-work-deserves-professional-tools-meet-aws-quick/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
