      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The campaign celebrates the teams who know that the work they do every day deserves tools built for it.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/professional-work-deserves-professional-tools-meet-aws-quick/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T18:43:30.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:23.045Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Most of those tools started as consumer apps and still serve personal and professional use with the same product.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/professional-work-deserves-professional-tools-meet-aws-quick/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T18:43:30.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:23.045Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AWS Quick took the opposite path: it was built for work from day one, on the same AWS infrastructure that millions of customers use to run their mission-critical applications.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/professional-work-deserves-professional-tools-meet-aws-quick/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T18:43:30.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:23.045Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Quick is integrated with the security and compliance tools you already use, including Microsoft Purview for data protection, AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM), and Microsoft Active Directory for permission-based controls.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/professional-work-deserves-professional-tools-meet-aws-quick/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T18:43:30.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:23.045Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Quick also carries the compliance certifications most organizations require, including HIPAA, FedRAMP, SOC 2, and ISO 27001.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/professional-work-deserves-professional-tools-meet-aws-quick/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T18:43:30.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:23.045Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
